      ],
      "image": "assets/images/32451/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Zest lemons; place zest in a large glass bottle or jar.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/q9yc1fOpS-Dg-_jdtVSV7HpZz1I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-32451-homemade-limoncello-DDMFS-4x3-step-02-9932e0faf0f2405790b14b4e2c911b21.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/32451/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour vodka into bottle with zest; cover loosely and let infuse at room temperature for 1 week.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pfxry9e4ua9iDm9q6Uo5vSbpuUY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-32451-homemade-limoncello-DDMFS-4x3-step-03-be855fda787f4e4d82262e325868b501.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/32451/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "After 1 week, combine water and sugar in a medium saucepan; bring to a boil but do not stir. Boil for 15 minutes. Remove from heat; cool syrup to room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ouN4vTuVeg1K-YCI_fJFIESKo3I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-32451-homemade-limoncello-DDMFS-4x3-step-04-b63c0538ea2448439d2e870b5e8d1ab6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/32451/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir vodka mixture into syrup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MwrU9AV7Iqwa6iUQ7nNbF_Fc2Io=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-32451-homemade-limoncello-DDMFS-4x3-step-05-1c3e99e4e6bf4f669c18734ed194e2c8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/32451/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strain into glass bottles; seal each bottle with a cork. Age at room temperature for 2 weeks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C4UpA0ml_-d9GQBGP7uIxsNGoYA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-32451-homemade-limoncello-DDMFS-4x3-step-06-b5c8735e5af34484acf6001240354dd9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/32451/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Store bottled limoncello in the freezer until icy cold. Serve in chilled vodka glasses or shot glasses.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
